            listOf("Savunmaya endirekt serbest vuruş", "Vuruş tekrarlanır", "Kale vuruşu", "Hakem atışı"), 0,
            "If the penalty is missed or saved after attacker encroachment, an indirect free kick is given to the defenders.",
